# /work paths staged in RAM by pipeos-hot and written back by `pipeos work
# flush` (hourly, before every save, at shutdown, before park). One relative
# path per line. Add a path here when something new churns the stick;
# never a path that is the only copy of something (Claude's transcripts,
# repos, homes, backups stay on disk).
logs
pipeos/mdns
.pipeos/ledger
.pipeos/schedule
